Pokémon Emerald 3Ds Dual Screen changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: follower Pokemon and Gen 6 icons, Spanish follower texts
Applies after 0037-soft-reset.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py, which first places the
files aarant/pokeemerald icons-followers adds and the graphics it changes ([followers] in upstream.lock).
These are its changes to existing files, merged with the port, and the port fixes they need.

